731	 * ({@code CLAIM_OPENED}), settled ({@code CLAIM_SETTLED}), left pending ({@code CLAIM_PENDING}), approved
732	 * ({@code CLAIM_APPROVED}), rejected ({@code CLAIM_REJECTED}) or voided ({@code CLAIM_VOIDED}) on a sheet.
733	 * The number is the claim's number, or null when it has none. The due is the due fixed by settling or
734	 * approving ({@code n/a} when there was no rate), or null when the event carries none. The reason is a
735	 * rejection's reason, or null when the event carries none.
